summary: Final piece of the v1.0 media-bin + timeline bundle. Made MEDIA sidebar rows draggable with a typed MediaRefPayload (`application/x-atelier-media-ref`). Attached drop targets to canvasMount AND timelineMount that POST `/api/media/ingest?targetDocPath=…&source=existing&path=media/…` to compose with the existing media (no file re-upload). Discriminates from file-drop via dataTransfer.types so the DropZone overlay stays intact. Kind-guarded — only video/image/audio rows draggable; font/other rows non-draggable since they can't compose. Tests still 1189, tsc clean.
